               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The Law of Morale\n\nDo not stop after a single exercise. To reinforce what you have learned, practice until you feel more comfortable, and spread your practice across more than one day.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "8f23ec56-fc1a-405c-95d9-5134e26ebed7",
         "prev": "f40ce0d4-d6a6-485e-80e7-097f8a5c84e8",
