               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=a4caa9fe-de1e-49c5-92de-50ed9c22a42d",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Terrain\n\nIn every addition, squares represent the digits. When a column carries 1, extra squares appear outside the group of ten.\n\nBefore adding two digits, ask yourself: is the second digit at least the complement of the first?\n\n- Yes: the column carries 1.\n- No: the sum stays below ten.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
