         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### What Comes Next\n\nYou have learned Sun Tzu's five factors: the law of morale, heaven, terrain, the commander, and method and discipline.\n\nIn the next classes, you will use them as a strategy for learning addition and other mathematical operations.",
